<title>INDIA: India sets 91-day t-bill cut-off at 98.34 rupees.</title>
<headline>India sets 91-day t-bill cut-off at 98.34 rupees.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) said it set a cut-off rate of 98.34 rupees at Friday's 91-day treasury bill auction.</p>
<p>Dealers said the yield worked out to 6.77 percent, unchanged from the previous auction.  </p>
<p>--</p>
